commit 1de6605a2092013f5f030418e977164ee5856247
Author: bryaninjapan <paperworkbybryan@gmail.com>
Date:   Thu Sep 3 12:17:22 2026 +0900

    fix(phase-17): resolve W1/W2/W4 before execution
    
    W1 (Coverage wording): Unified Handoff Criteria #6 from '≥80% for new files'
      to 'global coverage ≥85%' to match repo enforcement (vitest global threshold)
    
    W2 (ROADMAP SC4): Updated to reflect actual delivery pattern:
      'Schemas shared via .js mirror + parity test: public/js/calculator-rules.js
       mirrors backend schemas, sync enforced by parity test (divergence.js precedent)'
    
    W4 (Contract test wording): Changed invalid-schema test spec from
      'returns 400 with zod error details' to
      'returns 400 with error.code === VALIDATION_ERROR + non-empty message'
      (reflecting actual errorMiddleware response: sanitized envelope, no raw zod issues)
    
    All remaining warnings now have concrete implementation guidance. Ready for execution.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

